sentences.text:
The petitioner has approached this Court with the following prayers:
"(i) issue appropriate writ of mandamus or other appropriate writ or order directing respondents 1 and 2 to clear the goods covered by Ext.P3 Bill of Entry without insisting on NOC from the 3rd respondent under the Food Safety and Standards Act,2006;
b) Issue a writ of certiorari or other appropriate writ, order or direction quashing Ext.P6 inasmuch as it stipulates production of NOC from the 3rd respondent."
